      "writtenOn": "2019-07-19T00:20:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you show me that as a new patchset or a WIP CL? You don\u0027t have to replace all %T yet. I just want to see one example and how it looks.",
      "parentUuid": "11c7fa2d_f876c4c5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "0ab02441dc7eb1263fed95935d63bce7ad92e35a",
